{"articleNo":"72945","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=72945&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"청년 해외취업을 위한 2013년 글로벌 취업창업 대전 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.28","hit":"4121","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">대한무역투자진흥공사(KOTRA)에서는 청년들에게 해외일자리 기회 제공 및 글로벌 마인드 제고를 위해 아래와 같이 『2013 글로벌 취업창업 대전』을 개최하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참가 바랍니다.</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>행사명</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong>2013</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>년 글로벌 취업창업 대전<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>나</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>. </strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>일시 및 장소</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"